      "content": "No, you should not take Advil (ibuprofen) with Xarelto (rivaroxaban) without explicit approval from your doctor, as they both increase bleeding risk. Ibuprofen is generally avoided with blood thinners because it can impair platelet function and worsen both abdominal and menstrual bleeding. Please ask your doctor if they recommend a specific pain medication that is safer to take alongside Xarelto.",
